 // Render-pass barriers off while /Library/Preferences/com.droidvm.nmb-no-render-barrier exists (read once per process; a process
 // whose sandbox cannot see the file keeps them on): the A/B switch for them without restaging the plugin.
+// And never in a pass whose colour target is a panel-sized IOSurface: a barrier there (the bridge splits the pass) locked the Adreno up at
+// every 3200x2136 login (msm hangcheck, offending task v_gpu; none with barriers off, none at 1600x1068). RenderBox's coverage
+// read-backs are in offscreen targets (icons, glyphs, their atlases -- some larger than 4 Mpx: all blank when every big pass
+// lost its barriers), which keep them.
